01:23:02.894 --> 01:23:06.898
I'm still a villain
I don't even care about justice.

1259
01:23:06.982 --> 01:23:09.275
Justice is weak and empty

1260
01:23:11.361 --> 01:23:14.280
No villain can beat this

1261
01:23:15.156 --> 01:23:18.159
If merciless justice
If it exists in the world

1262
01:23:18.243 --> 01:23:20.453
I am willing to lose

1263
01:23:21.830 --> 01:23:25.500
Villains also live in a peaceful world
Because I want to live

1264
01:23:26.668 --> 01:23:30.588
But this world is impossible
I got a new hobby

1265
01:23:31.256 --> 01:23:32.966
clearing out trash

1266
01:23:33.550 --> 01:23:37.387
If you don't take out the trash
Because they get crushed by trash and die

1267
01:23:41.725 --> 01:23:45.562
Finally, from the villain's perspective
There is one thing I want to say

1268
01:24:09.878 --> 01:24:10.879
[Music that heightens the mood]

1269
01:24:59.886 --> 01:25:01.805
[Exciting music]

1270
01:26:43.781 --> 01:26:46.492
[Rhythmic music]

1271
01:27:53.101 --> 01:27:55.144
Subtitle: Kwon Jeong-won

